sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Rotation must change and test the database credential
accDescr: The rotation Lambda creates a pending secret, applies its password to the database, tests it, and only then promotes that secret version to current.
participant S as Secrets Manager
participant L as Rotation Lambda
participant D as MySQL user
S->>L: Start scheduled rotation
L->>S: Create random AWSPENDING version
L->>D: Apply pending password
L->>D: Test login with pending credential
D-->>L: Authentication succeeds
L->>S: Move AWSCURRENT to tested version
Note over S,D: Initial user provisioning precedes rotation
